1
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,070
You were the most dangerous operative they've ever created, but now the beekeepers have gone rogue,

2
00:00:15,870 --> 00:00:18,550
and you're the only one who can stop them.

3
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:27,590
The beekeepers want complete control of the government, and they're prepared to kill anyone who gets in the way.

4
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:34,140
If we're gonna go up against the beekeepers, we're gonna do it my way.

5
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:35,980
I would hope for nothing less.

6
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,580
I got you a car.

7
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,520
1969 Dodge Super Bee.

8
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,400
Fully loaded with Stinger.

9
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:01,100
Welcome back, Clay.

10
00:01:09,860 --> 00:01:11,360
Next time, don't be so hard-headed.

